#: ../doc/index.rst:21
msgid "OpenShot User Guide"
msgstr "Vodič za korisnike OpenShota"

#: ../doc/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"OpenShot Video Editor is a free, award-winning, open-source video editor, "
"available on Linux, Mac, Chrome OS, and Windows. OpenShot can create "
"stunning videos, films, and animations with an easy-to-use interface and "
"rich set of features."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot Video Editor je besplatan, nagrađivani, otvoreni video editor, "
"dostupan na Linuxu, Macu, Chrome OS-u i Windowsu. OpenShot može stvarati "
"zadivljujuće videozapise, filmove i animacije s jednostavnim sučeljem i "
"bogatim skupom značajki."

